{"assets":["/statement-assets/c1e7238d28dd48681c64d2165534f778f1d51b5634f6f3539900656af63797ad.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"500","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. New Year Shopping"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Dohyun is running a grocery store. He sells "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" items numbered by integers from 1 to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":". The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ i ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":") of them costs "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" dollars, and if I buy it, my happiness increases by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"hi"},{"kind":"text","text":". Each item can be displayed only for "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p"},{"kind":"text","text":" units of time because of freshness. As Dohyun displays the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th item at time "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ti"},{"kind":"text","text":", the customers can buy the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th item only from time "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ti"},{"kind":"text","text":" to time "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ti + (p - 1)"},{"kind":"text","text":" inclusively. Also, each customer cannot buy the same item more than once."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"I'd like to visit Dohyun's grocery store and buy some items for the New Year Party, and maximize my happiness. Because I am a really busy person, I can visit the store only once, and for very short period of time. In other words, if I visit the store at time "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":", I can only buy the items available at time "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":". But I can buy as many items as possible, if the budget holds. I can't buy same item several times due to store rules. It is not necessary to use the whole budget."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"I made a list of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" pairs of integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(aj, bj)"},{"kind":"text","text":", which means I may visit the store at time "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"aj"},{"kind":"text","text":", and spend at most "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bj"},{"kind":"text","text":" dollars at the store. For each pair, I'd like to know the maximum happiness I can obtain. But there are so many pairs that I can't handle them. Can you help me?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 4000"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ p ≤ 10 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of items, and the display time of each item."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines describe the items. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ i ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":") of them contains three space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"hi"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ti"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ci, hi ≤ 4000"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ti ≤ 10 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the cost of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th item, the happiness of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th item, and the time when the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th item starts to be displayed."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line contains an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ q ≤ 20 000"},{"kind":"text","text":")— the number of candidates."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines describe the candidates. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ j ≤ q"},{"kind":"text","text":") of them contains two space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"aj"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bj"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ aj ≤ 20 000"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ bj ≤ 4000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the visit time and the budget for "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th visit of store."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each candidate, print a single line containing the maximum happiness that I can obtain by buying some items."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 4\n2 3 2\n3 5 1\n4 7 2\n11 15 5\n4\n1 3\n2 5\n2 6\n5 14\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n8\n10\n18\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 4\n3 2 1\n7 4 4\n2 1 2\n6 3 5\n3 2 2\n10\n1 5\n2 5\n4 8\n4 9\n4 10\n5 8\n5 9\n5 10\n8 4\n7 9\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n3\n5\n5\n6\n4\n5\n6\n0\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Consider the first sample. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/c1e7238d28dd48681c64d2165534f778f1d51b5634f6f3539900656af63797ad.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" At time 1, only the 2nd item is available. I can buy the 2nd item using 3 dollars and my happiness will increase by 5. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" At time 2, the 1st, 2nd, and 3rd item is available. I can buy the 1st item using 2 dollars, and the 2nd item using 3 dollars. My happiness will increase by 3 + 5 = 8. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" At time 2, the 1st, 2nd, and 3rd item is available. I can buy the 1st item using 2 dollars, and the 3nd item using 4 dollars. My happiness will increase by 3 + 7 = 10. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" At time 5, the 1st, 3rd, and 4th item is available. I can buy the 1st item using 2 dollars, and the 4th item using 11 dollars. My happiness will increase by 3 + 15 = 18. Note that I don't need to use the whole budget in this case. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"500F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/500/problem/F"}